{"id":746,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"When it senses danger, its eyes tear up. The sparkle of its tears signals other Wishiwashi to gather."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Individually, they’re incredibly weak. It’s by gathering up into schools that they’re able to confront opponents."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"When it’s in a jam, its shining eyes attract others of its kind. The light from its eyes is visible almost 25 miles away."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"They’re weak, so they move in schools. However, they can also often be seen all alone, having strayed from the school."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It’s awfully weak and notably tasty, so everyone is always out to get it. As it happens, anyone trying to bully it receives a painful lesson."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"When it’s in trouble, its eyes moisten and begin to shine. The shining light attracts its comrades, and they stand together against their enemies."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Schooling","hidden":false,"description":"When it has a lot of HP, the Pokémon forms a powerful school. It stops schooling when its HP is low."}],"eggGroups":["Water 2"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":null,"color":"Blue","shape":"Fish","evolution":{"id":746,"name":"Wishiwashi","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,45],[1,55],[4,270],[8,251],[12,362],[16,715],[20,291],[24,487],[28,253],[32,401],[36,392],[40,283],[44,56],[48,38]],"machine":[213,251,362,523,291,89,203,263,258,270,56,58,231,710,341,330,182,240,156,496,503,214,173,164,57,369,253,127,250],"egg":[54,36,352],"tutor":[812,799]},"cards":[{"id":"me55-22","name":"Wishiwashi","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Common","number":"22","artist":"Narano","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-22/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-22/large"},{"id":"swsh7-46","name":"Wishiwashi","set":"Evolving Skies","date":"2021-08-27","rarity":